urname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Kerr</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Interatrial septal mobility predicts larger shunts across patent foramen ovales: an analysis with transmitral Doppler scanning</article-title><source>Am Heart J</source><year>2003</year><volume>145</volume><fpage>730</fpage><lpage>736</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12679772</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1067/mhj.2003.5</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>